        "description": "Use this tool to initiate a UCP checkout for a parking reservation. Exactly one line item must be provided. Put the SpotHero facility ID (from search_parking) in the line item's item.facility_id field, and ensure the reservation end time is in the future. The line item's totals must resolve to the total_price of the chosen search_parking rate: either send one entry of type 'total', or send the rate's price_breakdown components, which are summed. Returns a checkout object with a unique ID that can be used to retrieve or complete the checkout.",
        "inputSchema": {
          "type": "object",
